{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34007","headline":"南阳广文欲於荆襄卜居因而有赠 · 皮日休","name":"南阳广文欲於荆襄卜居因而有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地脉从来是福乡，广文高致更无双。\n青精饭熟云侵竈，白{衤劫}裘成雪溅窗。\n度日竹书千万字，经冬术煎两三缸。\n鲈鱼自是君家味，莫背松江忆汉江。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}